  "instructions": [
    "Mix paprika, grated ginger, garlic, fermented fish sauce, soy sauce, sugar, and rice vinegar in a bowl.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced pork belly to the pan and cook for 2 minutes on each side.",
    "Soften the long-fermentation dough in a separate pan with a little water.",
    "Assemble the bánh mì wraps by placing a piece of dough on a plate, adding some pickled carrots and daikon, sliced cucumber, and a few slices of pork belly.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro and serve immediately."
